From b45328dfb29f26b97aec45bb8f766d61c0434435 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 12:24:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restore old kernel configs and lower version requirements for
 GSI

Restore kernel config definitions for older Android releases (P/4.4,
Q/4.9, R/4.14, R/4.19, S/4.14, S/4.19) that were removed from the
GrapheneOS kernel/configs tree. These are required for GSI
compatibility with vendor partitions that shipped with these older
kernel versions.

Lower q/android-4.9 minlts from 4.9.165 to 4.9.141 and remove
CONFIG_XFRM_INTERFACE and USB/RTL8152 dependencies that are not
available on older kernel point releases.

Lower s/android-4.19 minlts from 4.19.191 to 4.19.127 for MediaTek
devices that ship 4.19 kernels at earlier point releases.

Change-Id: Id8e1df272b30ff60d02a650eb2b644fff4668688
